    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> STAT_U03_L06_GP_Q03</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.STAT.BVM.7</p><p>A row has counts 12 and 18. What is the row total?</p>]]></text>
